    "content": "Short answer\nCovenants restrict certain possibilities for the future spending of a UTXO. The constructions and guarantees depend on the mechanisms available or proposed.\n\nExplanation\n- The owner accepts a spending rule that can limit the form or the destinations of later transactions.\n- The uses discussed include protective vaults and congestion management; the different proposals do not offer the same capabilities.\n\nLimits and confusions\nOP_CAT and OP_CTV must not be presented as activated without a dated verification.",
